    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sect Leader\u2019s Decree</i> is a turn-based colony builder focused on resource and time management. Construct buildings, research technologies, gather resources, and train your disciples to guide your sect to prosperity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Expand</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade a range of buildings, from dormitories to research labs. Each building plays a crucial role in enhancing your sect\u2019s growth and unlocking new possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/df962a099a7e5fe7abc558435a90412c.poster.avif?t=1749511787\" width=584 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/df962a099a7e5fe7abc558435a90412c.webm?t=1749511787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/df962a099a7e5fe7abc558435a90412c.mp4?t=1749511787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Technologies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new technologies to improve efficiency, learn new building upgrades, and discover new resources. Each completed research brings your sect closer to prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/3fbebfce76f2821624dcaf95c67baf98.poster.avif?t=1749511787\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/3fbebfce76f2821624dcaf95c67baf98.webm?t=1749511787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/3fbebfce76f2821624dcaf95c67baf98.mp4?t=1749511787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a variety of resources, from food to building materials. Keep in mind that resources decay over time, so plan wisely not to waste them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/f3e5f3f40de226bd23bf1187d3994ec7.poster.avif?t=1749511787\" width=800 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/f3e5f3f40de226bd23bf1187d3994ec7.webm?t=1749511787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/f3e5f3f40de226bd23bf1187d3994ec7.mp4?t=1749511787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed Your Disciples</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure your disciples don\u2019t go hungry! Balanced nutrition is key to maintaining their health and productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/a8e54a1a87d7a85608553cf8e3210008.poster.avif?t=1749511787\" width=580 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/a8e54a1a87d7a85608553cf8e3210008.webm?t=1749511787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/a8e54a1a87d7a85608553cf8e3210008.mp4?t=1749511787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face random events that can either challenge or benefit your sect. Adapt your strategies to weather natural disasters or seize unexpected opportunities. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/478af0e105993ddce974734a7885f0cb.poster.avif?t=1749511787\" width=800 height=639 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/478af0e105993ddce974734a7885f0cb.webm?t=1749511787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey as a sect leader has just begun. Build a strong, prosperous sect, guide your disciples wisely, and cultivate a legacy that will be remembered for generations.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sect Leader\u2019s Decree</i> is a turn-based colony builder focused on resource and time management. Construct buildings, research technologies, gather resources, and train your disciples to guide your sect to prosperity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Expand</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade a range of buildings, from dormitories to research labs. Each building plays a crucial role in enhancing your sect\u2019s growth and unlocking new possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/df962a099a7e5fe7abc558435a90412c.poster.avif?t=1749511787\" width=584 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/df962a099a7e5fe7abc558435a90412c.webm?t=1749511787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/df962a099a7e5fe7abc558435a90412c.mp4?t=1749511787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Technologies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new technologies to improve efficiency, learn new building upgrades, and discover new resources. Each completed research brings your sect closer to prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/3fbebfce76f2821624dcaf95c67baf98.poster.avif?t=1749511787\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/3